title: EchoState
act: Mine
location: Deep
quest: echo
color: blue
---
// The echo of the deep level is a project of its own, loaded with the game and played by a runner of its own in the
// deep level's scene. It shares the game's variables with the story: the story declares $echo_answered too, and reads
// what the echo set; $echo_riddles is the echo's alone.
/// The echo was answered.
<<declare $echo_answered = false>>
/// How many riddles the echo asked.
<<declare $echo_riddles = 0>>
===

title: Echo
act: Mine
location: Deep
quest: echo
when: not $echo_answered
---
<<set $echo_riddles to $echo_riddles + 1>>
<<if $echo_riddles == 1>>
    Echo: Who calls? Who calls? Who calls? #line:Echo.0eec2c8c_0100_Echo
    Echo: Answer, and I will be quiet. Fail, and I will say your name all night. #line:Echo.0eec2c8c_0200_Echo
<<else>>
    Echo: Back again. The [ordinal value={$echo_riddles} one="%st" two="%nd" few="%rd" other="%th" /] riddle, then. #line:Echo.0eec2c8c_0300_Echo
<<endif>>
<<jump EchoRiddle>>
===

title: EchoRiddle
act: Mine
location: Deep
quest: echo
---
// Each visit throws a die for the riddle.
<<declare $echo_roll = 0>>
<<set $echo_roll to dice(3)>>
<<if $echo_roll == 1>>
    Echo: I have a bed but never sleep, a mouth but never eat. What am I? #line:EchoRiddle_0100_Echo
    -> A river. #line:EchoRiddle_0200
        <<jump EchoRight>>
    -> A mine. #line:EchoRiddle_0300
        <<jump EchoWrong>>
    -> A lantern. #line:EchoRiddle_0400
        <<jump EchoWrong>>
<<elseif $echo_roll == 2>>
    Echo: The more you take, the more you leave behind. What are they? #line:EchoRiddle_0500_Echo
    -> Footsteps. #line:EchoRiddle_0600
        <<jump EchoRight>>
    -> Coins. #line:EchoRiddle_0700
        <<jump EchoWrong>>
    -> Years. #line:EchoRiddle_0800
        <<jump EchoWrong>>
<<else>>
    Echo: I speak without a tongue and hear without ears. What am I? #line:EchoRiddle_0900_Echo
    -> A bell. #line:EchoRiddle_1000
        <<jump EchoWrong>>
    -> An echo. #line:EchoRiddle_1100
        <<jump EchoRight>>
    -> A ghost. #line:EchoRiddle_1200
        <<jump EchoWrong>>
<<endif>>
===

title: EchoRight
act: Mine
location: Deep
quest: echo
---
Echo: Right. Right. Right... #line:EchoRight_0100_Echo
The voice fades into the stone, and the deep level is quiet. #line:EchoRight_0200
<<set $echo_answered to true>>
===

title: EchoWrong
act: Mine
location: Deep
quest: echo
---
Echo: Wrong. Wrong. Wrong... #line:EchoWrong_0100_Echo
The echo laughs, far away. It will ask again. #line:EchoWrong_0200
===

title: Echo
act: Mine
location: Deep
quest: echo
when: $echo_answered
---
=> The hole in the rock is quiet. #line:Echo.4757ee5d_0100
=> Something drips, far down. The echo says nothing. #line:Echo.4757ee5d_0200
===
